mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; - <u>1학년 대상 교양교과목 중 1학년 수강신청&nbsp;기회가 없었던&nbsp;일부 교과목은&nbsp;27일 신청이 불가합니다</u>. </span></span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff007f\">재수강등의 사유로 수강신청 해야하는 과목은 3.6.~3.8.(수강신청 확인변경기간)&nbsp;에 신청하면 </font>됩니다.</span></span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>□ </strong></span></span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년도 신입생 수강신청 </span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - MSC 기초반 편성 등 시간표가 확정되지 않아&nbsp;<u>전체학년 수강신청&nbsp;기간에는 수강신청 하지 않습니다.</u></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2월 28일경 기초반을 포함한 시간표가 편성될 예정이며,</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff007f\">2017학년도 신입생은 수강신청 확인 및 변경기간(3.6.~3.8.) 09:30부터 수강신청사이트를 우선 오픈할 예정이니</font>,&nbsp;시간에 맞추어 수강신청 하시기 바랍니다.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타 수강신청에 대한 자세한 사항은 학사안내 공지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">“2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년도 1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기 학부 수강신청 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">” 및 \"2017학년도 전체학년 수강신청\" &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span>참조</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
